{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "main_6_level_main_06-12_end",
  "groupId": "main_6",
  "stageId": "main_06-12",
  "title": "冰原之霜",
  "storyCode": "6-14",
  "avgTag": "行動後",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/tw/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_06-12_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "cd42a6d8c13c3ac9a67f779c03e9ce5a3185e5264587ad1d331a199432af56c8",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "第二关（后）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合運動成員",
      "text": "居然......雪怪居然......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合運動成員",
      "text": "......真慘。真就全死在這龍門了。感染者的希望和傳說又少了一個。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合運動成員",
      "text": "快走，近衛局的人要追下來了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "九",
      "text": "我知道。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合運動成員",
      "text": "......你的眼神有些不大對。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合運動成員",
      "text": "說實話，原本我一直懷疑你是龍門那邊的臥底。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "九",
      "text": "那現在呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合運動成員",
      "text": "反正別人都不信就是了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "九",
      "text": "真的間諜會殺你滅口。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合運動成員",
      "text": "我其實真不怕你殺我。看看龍門這樣子。哪怕你是龍門人，你也回不去了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合運動成員",
      "text": "因為你會比我們過得還慘。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "九",
      "text": "......所以我不是。我現在已經什麼都不是了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合運動成員",
      "text": "你在幹什麼？咦，開花了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合運動成員",
      "text": "哦哦，這是你的法術嗎？有點好看啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "九",
      "text": "總得有人給他們留一點點敬意。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "監察司",
      "text": "磨磨蹭蹭的......花了那麼長時間。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "我覺得做得很不錯。一天之內就消滅了龍門城內的全部整合運動，我可以給最高分。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "魏彥吾了不得。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "太合，你有沒有聽過那個傳聞？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "監察司",
      "text": "你是說魏彥吾的身世？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太合",
      "text": "勿論上事。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "抱歉。不過，那些黑蓑的身手與當今禁軍相比，何如？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "監察司",
      "text": "哼，你也太高估他們了。他們的確有過人之處不假.......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太合",
      "text": "當心！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "你們這些混帳！！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "監察司",
      "text": "——感染者？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "嘶。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "text": "——絞合線？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "你並不想真的殺我，對嗎？你本來能用法術的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "text": "我聽說用線做武器的男人，無一例外全是心理變態。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "確實總有人這麼說......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "監察司",
      "text": "感染者，別妨害公務。小心我把你一併處理了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "text": "沒有身份識別碼的武裝人員在戰場上遭到殺害，這種事根本怨不得人吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "我們同樣可以指證你與這些整合運動有所勾連。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "你們還沒有調查我合作夥伴的權限。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "但我們已經知道有一艘屬於“感染者對策專家”的艦船停在龍門泊區，陳警司。這也是這位煌小姐尚未收到傷害的唯一理由。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "那諸位還要看到什麼時候？還要再給龍門人的出生入死打幾次分？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "監察司",
      "text": "說話放尊重點。龍門風險控制能力的評估，本來就是因為重視你們才做的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "那真抱歉，我換種說法吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "我們這場鬧劇，三位看得盡興不？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "監察司",
      "text": "嘁。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "煌，收手吧，這三位貴人不是你我該伺候的，穿雨披的那些也確實不是他們的同行人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "抱歉，煌小姐。希望我剛剛沒有讓你產生不快。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "text": "......你挺有禮貌的。但我很討厭你說話的語氣。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "你的炎腔味道很正。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "你的確繼承了你父親不少東西。只不過，現在的你只是個感染者，路很難走，也很短。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "text": "......你......？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太合",
      "text": "走。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "那麼再會，煌小姐，陳警司。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "text": "等一下！你剛才說我爸什麼！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "text": "站住！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "text": "煌！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "text": "不要忘了任務！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "text": "我知道。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "text": "陳長官。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "我們沒發現敵人指揮官的蹤跡。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "text": "哪一位？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "我們只知道梅菲斯特。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "text": "接下來的追擊，就由我們羅德島來完成。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "不用太冒進。這場戰役實質上已經結束了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "text": "但他犯下的暴行......必須要被償還。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "交給你們了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "那麼我們就各自出發吧。我還有件必須要去親眼驗證的事。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "text": "等等，近衛局的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "有什麼事？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "text": "......剛才謝謝你了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "text": "沒別的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "呵，彼此彼此。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "text": "為什麼一定要挑剛才的時機行動？煌......你不是在這種時候做出錯誤判斷的人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "text": "一是我真的很火......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "text": "二是我一早就看出來，近衛局那個姓陳的也會很火。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "text": "我們也沒法判斷出兩方誰究竟更有話語權。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "text": "所以我就挑我樂意的那個來。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "text": "不好意思，下次不會了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "text": "......不，煌。這句話該我說。我想說，“下次不會了”。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "text": "但我不敢這麼說。我不敢......不敢這麼承諾。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "text": "雪怪......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "text": "傻兔子。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "text": "哎，不要摸頭，會長不高......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "text": "......別摸太長時間吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "text": "我知道，我知道。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "感覺如何？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "是你。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "......",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "有何貴幹？",
          "value": "3",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凱爾希",
          "text": "恰巧路過。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凱爾希",
          "text": "你們的情感狀態有些起伏不定。看來在切城廢城，你們和這支整合運動的小隊有過更深層次的交流。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凱爾希",
          "text": "據我觀察，這支小隊的隊長沒有參與這場戰鬥。",
          "portraitKey": null
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "你的意思是......",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凱爾希",
          "text": "龍門的視線不會再繼續跟著感染者走，但羅德島的視野遠比單一一座城邦要廣闊。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凱爾希",
          "text": "接下來發生的事情，龍門不會干涉，你們也可以選擇不去參與。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凱爾希",
          "text": "......但你們會的。無論是代號“梅菲斯特”的感染者，還是代號“霜星”的感染者。",
          "portraitKey": null
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "你去哪？",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凱爾希",
          "text": "我有我要做的事情。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凱爾希",
          "text": "還有，Dr.{@nickname}......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凱爾希",
          "text": "別用那種眼神看著我。",
          "portraitKey": null
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "別再遮遮掩掩的了。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "......",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "阿米婭說了，羅德島需要信任關係。",
          "value": "3",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凱爾希",
          "text": "但你我之間不需要信任。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凱爾希",
          "text": "你需要羅德島幹員們的信任，不是我的。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凱爾希",
          "text": "——我太瞭解你了，所以我不會信任你。這就像過去的你也不會信任我一樣。",
          "portraitKey": null
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "我又怎麼知道以前的事情？",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "過去？",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "現在的我有什麼能做的嗎？",
          "value": "3",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凱爾希",
          "text": "......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凱爾希",
          "text": "對。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凱爾希",
          "text": "......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凱爾希",
          "text": "我失言了。不用理會我之前的話。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凱爾希",
          "text": "接下來的行動，小心一點。只有最危險的指揮官才會訓練出這種奮戰至死都沒有退後半寸的感染者小隊。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凱爾希",
          "text": "當然，要不要看到最後，由你們決定。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凱爾希",
          "text": "以及，節省體力。之後我們可能沒什麼時間休息。",
          "portraitKey": null
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "龍門的戰鬥已經結束了。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凱爾希",
          "text": "事情並沒有那麼簡單，至少我是這麼認為的。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凱爾希",
          "text": "Dr.{@nickname}，現在開始，你是否肩負著羅德島的責任，由你自己決定......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凱爾希",
          "text": "......“是否要成為一個值得羅德島幹員信任的人。”",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "幻影弩手",
          "text": "啊，霜星小姐，你醒了......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "幻影弩手",
          "text": "......慢慢來！我來幫你。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜星",
          "text": "沒事。不用......太拘謹。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "幻影弩手",
          "text": "——",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "幻影弩手",
          "text": "你往哪走？你不能回去。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜星",
          "text": "......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜星",
          "text": "所以我的兄弟姐妹們......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "幻影弩手",
          "text": "......但你不能回去！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "幻影弩手",
          "text": "他們就是為了你才......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜星",
          "text": "不要侮辱我的小隊！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "幻影弩手",
          "text": "呃！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜星",
          "text": "他們確實......咳，會為了我著想。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜星",
          "text": "但他們是為了感染者英勇赴死的！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜星",
          "text": "他們最後的戰鬥，是為了能讓更多的同胞活下去，不是為了哪一個人的生命！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜星",
          "text": "咳，咳咳，咳......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜星",
          "text": "咳，呃......嗚......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "幻影弩手",
          "text": "霜星小姐，你......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜星",
          "text": "下意識地叫我小姐，是因為我現在看起來柔弱了嗎？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "幻影弩手",
          "text": "......！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "幻影弩手",
          "text": "對不起！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "幻影弩手",
          "text": "只是，他們確實這樣把你託付給了我們。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜星",
          "text": "可我連答應他們的事情都沒有做到就已經失去了他們。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜星",
          "text": "我連補償的機會都沒有了。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "幻影弩手",
          "text": "霜星......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜星",
          "text": "......牆腳那個。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜星",
          "text": "梅菲斯特。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜星",
          "text": "他還沒有恢復意識？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "幻影弩手",
          "text": "我們不知道。他一直像現在這樣，什麼也不說，什麼也不做。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜星",
          "text": "......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜星",
          "text": "你們把他送回去吧。這就夠了。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "幻影弩手",
          "text": "明白。咻，我以為......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜星",
          "text": "以為什麼？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "幻影弩手",
          "text": "以為你會殺了他。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜星",
          "text": "已經不需要我去動手了。我似乎猜到了在貧民區外發生了什麼。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜星",
          "text": "他的眼神只屬於心灰意冷的人。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "幻影弩手",
          "text": "啊......？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜星",
          "text": "......而且，有時候......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜星",
          "text": "我會突然想起，在三四年以前，他想努力唱歌的樣子。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "幻影弩手",
          "text": "他能唱歌？可浮士德說過，他的嗓子......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜星",
          "text": "他有努力過。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜星",
          "text": "就像我們感染者，雖然最後都會被礦石病吞噬掉生命......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜星",
          "text": "卻還是努力想要活下去。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜星",
          "text": "讓他剩下的生命繼續懲罰他吧。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜星",
          "text": "告訴我，幻影弩手。羅德島參與了剛才的戰鬥嗎？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "幻影弩手",
          "text": "你是說......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "幻影弩手",
          "text": "......沒有。據我所知，沒有。他們沒有和雪怪們戰鬥。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜星",
          "text": "......太幼稚了。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "幻影弩手",
          "text": "你真要留下來？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "幻影弩手",
          "text": "他們不一定會繼續追擊，霜星。別在這裡耗費生命。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜星",
          "text": "我在廢城認識了幾個人，現在我還想再見他們一面。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜星",
          "text": "畢竟這是我的承諾。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜星",
          "text": "而且，我知道他們一定會來。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "幻影弩手",
          "text": "霜星......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜星",
          "text": "走吧，戰友。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜星",
          "text": "這場戰鬥，整合運動輸了，也許，整合運動也做錯了。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜星",
          "text": "但你們還沒有。你們還有得選，還有改正的機會。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜星",
          "text": "走吧。不要回頭。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
